.deltaTime) * speed","                }","            }","        }","    }","}"]},"doc://AdaEngine/tutorials/AdaEngine/UIBasics":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build a simple UI screen using Ada views. You will create a window, layout a few elements, and add a button with state."}],"type":"topic","kind":"project","title":"UI Basics","role":"project","estimatedTime":"15min","url":"\/tutorials\/adaengine\/uibasics","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaEngine\/tutorials\/AdaEngine\/UIBasics"},"doc://AdaEngine/tutorials/AdaEngine/UIBasics#Create-the-app-shell":{"type":"section","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Build a simple UI screen using Ada views. You will create a window, layout a few elements, and add a button with state."}],"kind":"section","title":"Create the app shell","role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/adaengine\/uibasics#Create-the-app-shell","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaEngine\/tutorials\/AdaEngine\/UIBasics#Create-the-app-shell"},"doc://AdaEngine/tutorials/AdaEngine/CreateFirst2DScene#Make-it-move":{"type":"section","url":"\/tutorials\/adaengine\/createfirst2dscene#Make-it-move","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaEngine\/tutorials\/AdaEngine\/CreateFirst2DScene#Make-it-move","title":"Make it move","kind":"section","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"In this tutorial, you will learn how to create your first 2D scene using Ada."}],"role":"pseudoSymbol"},"doc://AdaEngine/tutorials/AdaEngine/PlayerAndText":{"kind":"project","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"In this tutorial, you will learn how to add a player component that you can control and how to add text and various labels to your game scene."}],"type":"topic","url":"\/tutorials\/adaengine\/playerandtext","role":"project","title":"Player and Text in Ada","estimatedTime":"5min","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaEngine\/tutorials\/AdaEngine\/PlayerAndText"},"GP-2-5-system.swift":{"highlights":[{"line":36},{"line":37},{"line":38},{"line":39}],"content":["import AdaEngine","","@PlainSystem","struct GamepadInputSystem {","","    @FilterQuery<Ref<Transform>, With<PlayerComponent>>","    private var playerQuery","","    @Res<Input>","    private var input","","    @Res<DeltaTime>","    private var deltaTime","","    init(world _: World) {}","","    func update(context _: UpdateContext) {","        let gamepads = input.getConnectedGamepads()","","        if gamepads.isEmpty {","            return","        }","","        for gamepad in gamepads {","            let leftStickX = gamepad.getAxisValue(.leftStickX)","            let leftStickY = gamepad.getAxisValue(.leftStickY)","            let deadzone: Float = 0.1","","            if abs(leftStickX) > deadzone || abs(leftStickY) > deadzone {","                playerQuery.forEach { transform in","                    let speed: Float = 2.0","                    transform.position.x += leftStickX * Float(deltaTime.deltaTime) * speed","                    transform.position.y -= leftStickY * Float(deltaTime.deltaTime) * speed","                }","            }","","            if gamepad.isGamepadButtonPressed(.x) {","                gamepad.rumble(lowFrequency: 0.5, highFrequency: 0.75, duration: 0.5)","            }","        }","    }","}"],"fileType":"swift","identifier":"GP-2-5-system.swift","type":"file","fileName":"GamepadInputSystem.swift","syntax":"swift"},"GP-1-3-app.swift":{"highlights":[{"line":24},{"line":25}],"fileType":"swift","content":["import AdaEngine","","@Component","struct PlayerComponent {}","","@main","struct GamepadInputApp: App {","    var body: some AppScene {","        DefaultAppWindow()","            .transformAppWorlds { appWorld in","                appWorld.spawn(","                    \"Camera\",","                    bundle: Camera2D(","                        camera: Camera(),","                        transform: Transform(position: [0, 0, 0])","                    )","                )","","                appWorld.spawn(\"Player\") {","                    PlayerComponent()","                    Transform(scale: .init(0.5))","                    Sprite(tintColor: .red)","                }","","                appWorld.addSystem(GamepadInputSystem.self)","            }","            .windowMode(.windowed)","            .windowTitle(\"Gamepad Input\")","    }","}"],"identifier":"GP-1-3-app.swift","type":"file","fileName":"GamepadInputApp.swift","syntax":"swift"},"doc://AdaEngine/tutorials/AdaEngine/GamepadInput#Read-buttons":{"type":"section","abstract":[{"text":"Build a small scene that spawns a player entity and moves it with a gamepad.","type":"text"}],"kind":"section","title":"Read buttons","role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/adaengine\/gamepadinput#Read-buttons","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaEngine\/tutorials\/AdaEngine\/GamepadInput#Read-buttons"},"doc://AdaEngine/tutorials/AdaEngine/EventListeners#Base-of-Event-Subscriber-pattern":{"type":"section","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"In this tutorial you will learn about the event listeners system in Ada."},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"How can you catch events and process them"}],"kind":"section","title":"Base of Event-Subscriber pattern","role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/adaengine\/eventlisteners#Base-of-Event-Subscriber-pattern","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaEngine\/tutorials\/AdaEngine\/EventListeners#Base-of-Event-Subscriber-pattern"},"doc://AdaEngine/tutorials/AdaEngine/EventListeners#Type-of-events":{"type":"section","abstract":[{"text":"In this tutorial you will learn about the event listeners system in Ada.","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"type":"text","text":"How can you catch events and process them"}],"kind":"section","title":"Type of events","role":"pseudoSymbol","url":"\/tutorials\/adaengine\/eventlisteners#Type-of-events","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaEngine\/tutorials\/AdaEngine\/EventListeners#Type-of-events"},"doc://AdaEngine/tutorials/AdaEngine/PlayerAndText#Add-Text-component":{"abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"In this tutorial, you will learn how to add a player component that you can control and how to add text and various labels to your game scene."}],"kind":"section","type":"section","url":"\/tutorials\/adaengine\/playerandtext#Add-Text-component","role":"pseudoSymbol","title":"Add Text component","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaEngine\/tutorials\/AdaEngine\/PlayerAndText#Add-Text-component"},"doc://AdaEngine/tutorials/AdaEngine":{"type":"topic","identifier":"doc:\/\/AdaEngine\/tutorials\/AdaEngine","url":"\/tutorials\/adaengine","kind":"overview","title":"Meet Ada","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Learn the basics of Ada and start developing your own games!"}],"role":"overview"}}}